{"page":362,"verses":[{"verse_key":"25:21","surah":25,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَرْجُونَ لِقَآءَنَا لَوْلَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَيْنَا ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ أَوْ نَرَىٰ رَبَّنَا ۗ لَقَدِ ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟ فِىٓ أَنفُسِهِمْ وَعَتَوْ عُتُوًّا كَبِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who do not fear to meet Us say, ‘Why are the angels not sent down to us?’ or ‘Why can we not see our Lord?’ They are too proud of themselves and too insolent.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَرْجُونَ","en_gloss":"expect","transliteration":"yarjūna","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِقَآءَنَا","en_gloss":"(the) meeting with Us","transliteration":"liqāanā","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَوْلَآ","en_gloss":"Why not","transliteration":"lawlā","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"are sent down","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"we see","transliteration":"narā","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَبَّنَا ۗ","en_gloss":"our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَقَدِ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"laqadi","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they have become arrogant","transliteration":"is'takbarū","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"within","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"25:21"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusihim