,"transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"25:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِلْإِنسَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"to the man","transliteration":"lil'insāni","verse_key":"25:29"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَذُولًۭا","en_gloss":"a deserter","transliteration":"khadhūlan","verse_key":"25:29"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٩","en_gloss":"(29)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:29"}]},{"verse_key":"25:30","surah":25,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ ٱلرَّسُولُ يَـٰرَبِّ إِنَّ قَوْمِى ٱتَّخَذُوا۟ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانَ مَهْجُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Messenger has said, ‘Lord, my people treat this Quran as something to be shunned,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولُ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūlu","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَـٰرَبِّ","en_gloss":"O my Lord","transliteration":"yārabbi","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَوْمِى","en_gloss":"my people","transliteration":"qawmī","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","en_gloss":"took","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āna","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَهْجُورًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a forsaken thing","transliteration":"mahjūran","verse_key":"25:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:30"}]},{"verse_key":"25:31","surah":25,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ جَعَلْنَا لِكُلِّ نَبِىٍّ عَدُوًّا مِّنَ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ ۗ وَكَفَىٰ بِرَبِّكَ هَادِيًا وَنَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but We have always appointed adversaries from the wicked, for every prophet: Your Lord is sufficient guide and helper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"25:3